{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54709","headline":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 四十七 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 四十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青天象，日月气来冲。\n北面气冲北面旺，南冲南旺任（川本、辛本、京本作「认」）西东，取此以爲宗（川本、辛本、京本作「踪」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54709.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54709","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}